  click UI_SETTINGS href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/SettingsTabView.swift#L526" "saveDistractions encodes the FamilyActivitySelection, stamps authorized from DistractionMonitor.isAuthorized, saves DistractionSettings, then apply(profile:force: true). authorizeDistractions calls DistractionMonitor.requestAuthorization (AuthorizationCenter.requestAuthorization(for: .individual)) and saves authorized." _blank
  click T_CV_TASK href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L164" "apply(profile:) after the launch reevaluate, not forced." _blank
  click K_DSET href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/DistractionSettings.swift#L20" "DistractionSettings: selectionData, dailyLimitMinutes 30, limitLadderEnabled, mirrorEnabled, authorized. Also read by StatsTabView." _blank
  click D_MON href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/DistractionMonitor.swift#L62" "apply(profile:force:). Reads profile wake and bedtime as the day window and the saved settings. Re-asks authorization once per launch when a selection exists and status is notDetermined. Skips when nudge.distractions.registeredSignature (wake, bed, limit, toggles, authorized, selection) is unchanged, unless forced. stopMonitoring both schedules, then: daily schedule wake → bed repeating, events nudge.limit.100 / 150 / 175 at limit, 1.5 × limit, 1.75 × limit minutes; weekly schedule Monday 00:00 → Sunday 23:59, event nudge.mirror at 7 × limit × 1.25. Stops monitoring when not authorized, no selection, or both kinds off." _blank
  click IOS_DA href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/deviceactivity" "Family Controls entitlement on Nudge and NudgeActivityMonitor; NudgeActivityMonitor/Info.plist declares com.apple.deviceactivity.monitor-extension. iOS runs the extension process when a threshold is crossed." _blank
  click R_REEVAL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/NudgeArbiter.swift#L482" "The arbiter calls writeSnapshot after it schedules (line 482), so the snapshot is as fresh as the schedule. A debounced pass and a pass with notifications off return before this line, so with notifications off no snapshot is written and the extension, which does not read that toggle, decides random (snapshot from another day)." _blank
  click D_SNAP href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/DistractionMonitor.swift#L219" "writeSnapshot(profile:modelContext:now:). Reads DayWindow.resolve(wake, bedtime), NudgeTask.dayLens for today (title, minutes, planned start and end), today's informational events with their duration, the latest CompletedTaskRecord and nudge.lastFocusSessionStartedAt. Writes writtenAt, dayStart, dayEnd, bedtime, items, lastWorkAt." _blank
  click K_DSNAP href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/DistractionSettings.swift#L53" "DistractionSnapshot as ISO 8601 JSON. The extension cannot open the SwiftData store." _blank
  click X_THRESH href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L50" "eventDidReachThreshold(_:activity:) in the NudgeActivityMonitor process. Reads only App Group defaults. Rung from the event name: nudge.limit.100 → 1, 150 → 2, 175 → 3. Decides first (line 84), then writes lastRungAt and lastRungDay (lines 86-87) before the silent check (line 90), so a silent decision still advances them." _blank
  click X_CRUMB href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L32" "crumb(_:) appends a timestamped line, capped at 40. intervalDidStart and intervalDidEnd also leave crumbs; post leaves posted or post FAILED." _blank
  click K_CRUMB href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L30" "The only evidence the app has that iOS called the extension. Read by DistractionMonitor.debugDump in DEBUG." _blank
  click X_GUARD href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L58" "nudge.mirror requires mirrorEnabled; the limit events require limitLadderEnabled. A mirror firing stamps nudge.distractions.mirrorLastFiredAt and posts the fixed MIRROR line: Hey, got a sec? I want to show you something." _blank
  click K_RUNG href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L24" "nudge.distractions.lastRungAt, lastRungDay, mirrorLastFiredAt. lastRungAt is used only when lastRungDay is today's stamp." _blank
  click X_DECIDE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/DistractionSettings.swift#L127" "LimitDecider.decide(snapshot:now:rung:lastRungAt:). No snapshot or from another day → random; inside an event → silent; before dayStart or after bedtime → random; within 60 min of bedtime → bedtimeTask (smallest task that fits) or windDown; rung outside 1...3 → random; else rung(n, calm when lastWorkAt is after lastRungAt)." _blank
  click X_SILENT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L90" "Only .silent stops the post. Every other decision, random included, posts." _blank
  click X_COPY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/DistractionSettings.swift#L100" "placeholderTitle: LIMIT 1 / 2 / 3, LIMIT BEDTIME, LIMIT WINDDOWN, RANDOM LIMIT. placeholderBody: the reason, the task that fits before bed, It's almost bedtime. Wind down., or Rung n with or without you worked since the last one. No AI copy." _blank
  click X_POST href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeActivityMonitor/DeviceActivityMonitorExtension.swift#L98" "post(id:title:body:category:userInfo:). UNMutableNotificationContent with categoryIdentifier category.limit or category.mirror (registered by the app), userInfo nudgeKind and rung, interruptionLevel timeSensitive, trigger nil (immediate). Ids nudge.ext.limit.yyyyMMdd.rung and nudge.ext.mirror.yyyyMMdd." _blank
  click UNC href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/unusernotificationcenter" "A tap on a mirror notification routes to the Stats tab; limit taps route to Tasks." _blank
